(1, 1001, 301, N'Laura Mitchell - Data analyst, 7yrs in banking. Salary expectation £60-70k. Very enthusiastic about the NHS Digital role we discussed. Spanish national, settled status confirmed. Some SQL gaps but willing to train up quickly.', 3, N'Permanent', N'WP963308B', N'REDACTED', N'11-27-76', 10, '2021-09-01T09:00:00', '2023-04-01T09:00:00'),
(2, 1002, 302, N'Hitesh Grewal - Business analyst/SQL developer. Looking for £55-62k perm, currently on £50k so wants modest uplift. Very personable, asked great questions about team structure. Some gaps in Excel/VBA but strong analytical thinking.', 3, N'Freelance', N'PN270948A', N'REDACTED', N'37-29-74', 8, '2021-09-01T09:00:00', '2023-04-01T09:00:00'),
(3, 1003, 303, N'Ciarán O''Brien - Graduate scheme Python developer. First role, keen learner. Salary expectation £30-35k. Nervous in interview but showed genuine enthusiasm. No professional experience yet so realistic about junior placement. Could be good for training-focused clients.', 2, N'Permanent', N'PT180111A', N'REDACTED', N'26-12-71', 12, '2021-09-01T09:00:00', '2023-04-01T09:00:00'),
(4, 1004, 304, N'Harpreet Grewal - C++ engineer, embedded systems background. Contract £520/day or £95k+ perm. Scottish accent, bit hard to understand on first call. Says she''s semi-retired but wants interesting contracts only. Very niche skill set - long placement timeline likely.', 3, N'Temporary', N'ET726680C', N'REDACTED', N'32-48-13', 24, '2021-09-01T09:00:00', '2023-04-01T09:00:00'),
