(25, 179, N'Account', N'Called Sophie at Deloitte — the permanent role brief we sent was spot-on. They want interviews with our 2 shortlisted candidates, slots available 18th & 20th April.', '2022-08-15T10:30:00', 11, '2022-08-15T10:30:00', 12),
