(1, 132, 353, '2022-09-14T14:00:00', 76, 113, N'Concerning - candidate appears burnt out, made several negative comments about previous employers and the industry generally. Skills are there but energy and enthusiasm completely absent. Probably not in right mindset for a new role.', 0, '2022-09-14T16:00:00', '2022-09-14T16:00:00'),
(2, 238, 464, '2022-09-14T14:00:00', 79, 278, N'Candidate has the experience on paper but answers felt rehearsed and lacked depth. When probed deeper on a legacy system project, couldn''t provide specifics. Honest but not impressed.', 0, '2022-09-14T16:00:00', '2022-09-14T16:00:00'),
(3, 205, 472, '2022-09-14T14:00:00', 291, 42, N'Outstanding - rare combination of strong technical depth and excellent interpersonal skills. Engaged thoughtfully with our architectural challenges and asked insightful follow-up questions. Highly recommend.', 1, '2022-09-14T16:00:00', '2022-09-14T16:00:00'),
(4, 247, 486, '2022-09-14T14:00:00', 34, 30, N'Strong performer - good balance of knowledge and humility about what they don''t know. Asked smart questions about team dynamics and tech roadmap. Reliable type. Recommend moving forward.', 1, '2022-09-14T16:00:00', '2022-09-14T16:00:00'),
(5, 222, 377, '2022-09-14T14:00:00', 213, 16, N'Good engineer with solid Java and Spring Boot knowledge. Asked thoughtful questions about deployment and DevOps practices. Bit reserved in personality but seems professional and reliable.', 0, '2022-09-14T16:00:00', '2022-09-14T16:00:00'),
