(7, 110, 465, '2022-09-14T14:00:00', 221, 147, N'Candidate was charming and told good stories about previous work but when we dug into specifics, couldn''t provide technical details. Felt more like a talks-a-good-game candidate than a doer.', 0, '2022-09-14T16:00:00', '2022-09-14T16:00:00'),
(8, 85, 493, '2022-09-14T14:00:00', 82, 193, N'Concerning - candidate appears burnt out, made several negative comments about previous employers and the industry generally. Skills are there but energy and enthusiasm completely absent. Probably not in right mindset for a new role.', 0, '2022-09-14T16:00:00', '2022-09-14T16:00:00'),
