(10, 78, 327, '2022-09-14T14:00:00', 2, NULL, N'Candidate was well-prepared and articulate but seemed overly focused on salary negotiations rather than the role itself. Technical ability adequate but not exceptional. Culture fit unclear - seemed disengaged during team discussion.', 0, '2022-09-14T16:00:00', '2022-09-14T16:00:00'),
